From afae8d79f0b9bcc8db3055c85e35936400f7b6c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Sgt.Bilko" <59089219+SgtBilko76@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:20:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 11/44] RRV bridge 0013: sprite coverage

Fukami tools/patches/pcsx2/0013 on ARMSX2. SpriteCov takes the last free
float of ARMSX2's pixel constant block (after SubstituteAlphaKeep/Value)
in GSDevice.h, the Vulkan/D3D11 shaders and the Metal header; the PS
selector keeps ARMSX2's stencil_counter beside sprite_cov. ARMSX2's
SnapSpriteEdgesToPixelGrid is skipped for draws whose edges RRV sprite
coverage or RrvLinearSpriteEdges has already placed.
